{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dFSjQsg6y41794562925.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報新世界發展計劃，供股集資最多250億元。</p><p></p><p>新世界今早停牌，原因是等待發出內幕消息的公告。《彭博》引述消息報道，新世界已聘請銀行安排供股事宜，擬集資最多250億元。控股股東鄭氏家族有意參與供股。</p><p></p><p>報道又指，銀行考慮以軟包銷方式參與今次股份發售。不會承諾以自有資金，包底未售出的股份，而是盡力尋找外部投資者認購。消息指，目前仍在討論安排，供股計劃未落實。新世界停牌前報4.87元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:39:52.742999+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T03:32:05.171442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:33:16.637584+00:00","content_hash":"abbbd5c21938534106f90769c243d06d5a519ab24775b06136d5714a4baa83ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:39:52.742999+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}